{"version":1,"content":"<p>發展局文物保育專員辦事處聯同城巴推出的「穿越北都・開篷巴士古蹟遊」，將於11月21日、22日及29日推出三條主題路線，串聯北都內12處法定古蹟及已獲評級歷史建築。</p><p>活動費用全免，名額先到先得，於11月6日至10日接受網上報名。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:41:22.312124+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T09:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T22:38:09.118645+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T09:38:27.784127+00:00","content_hash":"955b80945b29ba665f5bdfe0b1b28209361213ca1bcd2e6f8457220ddd536641","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}